From 9739b623a61fd1ab0a9cbdba4dda988a0d3ce252 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.local>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 05:11:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: OG image now uses real brand fonts (Gelasio + Geist
 Mono)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Fixes the typography mismatch flagged in review — previous version fell
back to whatever generic serif/monospace Vercel's edge runtime provided,
producing an OG image whose fonts didn't match the site's brand kit.

Changes:
- app/opengraph-image.tsx rewritten to load fonts at edge runtime via
  new URL(..., import.meta.url) — Vercel's canonical pattern for bundling
  assets with edge functions
- Fonts colocated in app/_fonts/ (Next.js private folder — underscore
  prefix keeps it out of the routing system):
  - Gelasio-Regular.ttf — 'Breachrr' roman
  - Gelasio-Italic.ttf — 'Security' italic (moss)
  - GeistMono-Regular.woff — eyebrow, URL, booking indicator
- Gelasio is a Georgia-metric-compatible open-source substitute — same
  as the brand-kit PNG wordmark exports use, since Georgia is a licensed
  Microsoft font that can't be redistributed
- Middle-dot rendered as a filled SVG circle (not a period character) at
  0.115em diameter, 0.2311em above baseline — matches the brand spec
- Refined typography sizes: wordmark 112px (was 120px), tagline 48px
  (was 44px) to compensate for Gelasio's slightly quieter italic weight

Rendered locally and verified: 1200x630 PNG, brand-correct typography,
paper canvas with hairline grid, moss middle-dot in the right spot.
---
 app/_fonts/GeistMono-Regular.woff | Bin 0 -> 13044 bytes
 app/_fonts/Gelasio-Italic.ttf     | Bin 0 -> 160268 bytes
 app/_fonts/Gelasio-Regular.ttf    | Bin 0 -> 147572 bytes
 app/opengraph-image.tsx           | 121 +++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 4 files changed, 95 insertions(+), 26 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 app/_fonts/GeistMono-Regular.woff
 create mode 100644 app/_fonts/Gelasio-Italic.ttf
 create mode 100644 app/_fonts/Gelasio-Regular.ttf

diff --git a/app/_fonts/GeistMono-Regular.woff b/app/_fonts/GeistMono-Regular.woff
new file mode 100644
